            "notes": "If you arent confident in ur aim go aimbot. But Aimbot only helps u with the easiest shots in ur mag so its kinda useless imo. As of current patch I STRONGLY advise against use.\n\nTimelapse is super underrated as its constant damage that helps u burn armor which is Tracers biggest weakness and starts coming into effect in rounds 2 and 3.\n\nPrioritise debuffing Purples as they are mind numbingly easy to apply on Tracer and incredibly powerful. U might think Weapon Jammer doesnt do a lot, but it provides u with  decent Attack Speed, Weapon Damage AND additional Armor (which is very nice). Also a bunch of other Tracer builds still wanna make u go Ammo and Attack Speed (which i think is silly but thats besides the point), which is why this item gains even more value as the Debuff-Amount Scales of Enemy Attack Speed especially in later rounds.",
